# <type>: <short summary>
#
# Examples:
# feat: add note graph view
# docs: add SRS and glossary
# fix: correct backlink generation
#
# Valid types:
#   feat, fix, docs, chore, refactor, test, perf, style, build, ci, revert
#
# Rules:
# - Use imperative mood
# - Keep subject line short
# - Do not end with a period
# - Add a body if the change is non-trivial
